    "# U = 8: plan reference and walker start\n",
    "\n",
    "The same L = 32 runs (χ_T = 8, 200 walkers, 60 + 200 blocks of 20 steps, seed 1234 unless noted) at U = 8, in five series. They differ in three static choices: the determinant the gate circuit is built on (`make_orbital_plan`), the determinant that freezes the per-sector kept counts (`plan_bonds`), and the determinant the walkers start from. \"NO\" is the determinant of the trial's most occupied natural orbitals.\n",
    "\n",
    "| series | gate circuit | kept counts | walker start | directory |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **RHF** | RHF | RHF | RHF | `sweep_L32_T8_U8/` |\n",
    "| **NO counts** | RHF | NO | RHF | `sweep_L32_T8_U8_NO/` |\n",
    "| **NO counts + start** | RHF | NO | NO | `sweep_L32_T8_U8_NOstart/` |\n",
    "| **full NO** | NO | NO | NO | `sweep_L32_T8_U8_NOplan/` (`plan_reference=\"natural\"`, `walker_start=\"natural\"`, now the defaults) |\n",
    "| **full NO, seed 4321** | NO | NO | NO | same directory, χ_w = 4 only, a second random seed |\n",
    "\n",
    "Reference: DMRG χ = 200 at U = 8 (`sweep_L32_T8_U8/reference.jsonl`).\n",
    "\n",
    "Some runs are still going. These cells read `blocks.jsonl` as it stands, so re-run them to update. A finished run shows trot's final blocking analysis (filled marker). An unfinished run shows the weighted mean of its sampling blocks so far (open marker), with a blocking error once it has 30 sampling blocks. A run whose total weight reached zero (every walker killed) is cut at that block. In this section **colour means the series** (blue RHF, orange NO counts, aqua NO counts + start, yellow full NO, magenta full NO seed 4321), not χ_w."
